# Real, necessary fix (Migration Plan Phase 9): `az acr build ... .`
# tars up this ENTIRE directory as the build context before any
# Dockerfile's own COPY instructions ever run — without this file, that
# included frontend/node_modules (a large, deeply-nested tree no
# backend Dockerfile ever needs), making every core_api/bff/investigation
# /reporting build needlessly slow the moment the frontend was scaffolded.
# frontend/dist is NOT excluded — bff/Dockerfile's own COPY needs it
# (the real React build, served same-origin — see bff/main.py).
.git
.venv
frontend/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
logs
output
